      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONSTRUCTION OF\nLA CONSOLACION ELEM. SCHOOL WATER SYSTEM,\nBRGY. LA CONSOLACION, MIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund Provincial Aid, Budget Year 2018 intends to apply the sum\nof P 239,406.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under\nthe contract for Supply and Delivery of Materials and Supplies for the Construction of\nLa Consolacion Elem. School Water System, Brgy. La Consolacion, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids\nreceived in excess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n62\nbags\nportland cement\n2\n8.5\ncu.m.\nscreened gravel\n3\n7\ncu.m.\nwashed sand\n4\n127\npcs\n12mm x 6./0 steel bars\n5\n26\nkgs\n#16 GI tie wire\n6\n24\nshts\n1/4\" x 4' x 8' ordinary plywood\n7\n11\npcs\n2\" x 3\" x 10' coco lumber\n8\n17\npcs\n2\" x 2\" x 10' coco lumber\n9\n18\npcs\nhacksaw blade\n10\n5\nkgs\nassorted nails (1\", 3\", 4\" CW nails)\n11\n9\npcs\n9mm x 6.0 steel bars\n12\n2\nkgs\n2\" common wire nails\n13\n420\nmtrs\n1 1/4\"Ø HDPE pipes SDR - II\n14\n7\npcs\n1 1/4\"Ø PE coupling\n15\n55\npcs\n3/4\" teflon tape\n16\n1\npc\n1 1/4\" Ø PE tee\n17\n1\npc\n1 1/4\" Ø PE end cap\n18\n11\npcs\n1 1/4\" Ø x 1/2\" Ø PE saddle clamp\n19\n16\npcs\n1 1/2\" Ø x 3m upvc blue pipe (solvent type)\n20\n16\npcs\n1/2\" x 1/2\" Ø upvc waterline male adapter\nND NPT - thred (PNS 65)\n21\n44\npcs\n1/2\" Ø x 12' GI nipple (S-20)\n22\n44\npcs\n1/2\" x 90°Gl nipple (S-20)\n23\n20\npcs\n1/2\" Ø x 4\" GI nipple (S-20)\n1",
